  "changes_data": [
    {
      "diff": "@@ -49,7 +49,7 @@ See the “New and Updated Features” section below for more details.\n \n The following features are either new or have been significantly updated since version 4.6.0:\n \n-* The Windows installers now ship with Npcap 1.87.\n+* The Windows installers now ship with Npcap 1.88.\n   They previously shipped with Npcap 1.83.\n \n * The Windows and macOS installers now ship with Qt 6.10.3.\n",
